---
import { OFFICES } from '../../lib/constants';

const office = OFFICES[1];
---

<section id="section-contacts-crimea" class="vn-contacts-crimea">
  <div class="vn-contacts-crimea__map-wrap">
    <iframe
      src={office.mapUrl}
      width="100%"
      height="480"
      title="Офис Михаила Хряпина в Бахчисарае (Крым)"
      loading="lazy"
      style="border:none; display:block; width:100%; height:480px;"
      allow="fullscreen"
    />

    <!-- Floating card RIGHT -->
    <div class="vn-contacts-crimea__card">
      <span class="vn-contacts-crimea__badge">Крым</span>
      <h2 class="vn-contacts-crimea__h2">Работаем с объектами по всему Крыму</h2>
      <p class="vn-contacts-crimea__sub">Ялта · Симферополь · Севастополь · побережье</p>

      <div class="vn-contacts-crimea__row vn-contacts-crimea__row--muted">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
        <span>Бахчисарай, {office.address}</span>
      </div>

      <div class="vn-contacts-crimea__divider"></div>

      <p class="vn-contacts-crimea__note">
        Объекты в Крыму рассматриваем дистанционно — по той же методологии, что и для Краснодара.
      </p>

      <a
        href="/contacts/#request"
        data-modal-open
        data-modal-title="Обсудить покупку в Крыму"
        class="vn-btn-primary vn-contacts-crimea__cta"
      >
        Обсудить покупку в Крыму
      </a>

      <div class="vn-contacts-crimea__route-row">
        <a href="https://yandex.ru/maps/-/CHQl5ZMo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="vn-contacts-crimea__route-btn">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 21 18 21 2 16 6 8 2 1 6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="18"/><line x1="16" y1="6" x2="16" y2="22"/></svg>
          Яндекс Карты
        </a>
        <a href="https://2gis.ru/crimea" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="vn-contacts-crimea__route-btn">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="3 11 22 2 13 21 11 13 3 11"/></svg>
          2ГИС
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="vn-contacts-crimea__footer-note">
    <p>Отдельная страница по новостройкам Крыма по военной ипотеке появится в ближайшее время.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .vn-contacts-crimea {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    position: relative;
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__map-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 480px;
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__map-wrap iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    border: none;
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__card {
    position: absolute;
    right: 48px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 380px;
    max-width: calc(100% - 96px);
    background: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 32px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(15, 20, 25, 0.14);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: var(--color-accent-soft);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__h2 {
    margin: 12px 0 8px;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__sub {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .vn-contacts-crimea__row--muted {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }
  .vn-contacts-crimea__row svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 16px 0;
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__note {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__cta {
    width: 100%;
    height: 44px;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__route-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__route-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--color-bg-surface);
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, background 150ms ease;
  }
  .vn-contacts-crimea__route-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent-cta);
    background: var(--color-accent-cta-soft);
  }

  .vn-contacts-crimea__footer-note {
    padding: 16px 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .vn-contacts-crimea__footer-note p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .vn-contacts-crimea__map-wrap {
      height: auto;
    }
    .vn-contacts-crimea__map-wrap iframe {
      height: 280px;
    }
    .vn-contacts-crimea__card {
      position: static;
      transform: none;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
      border-radius: 0;
      border-left: none;
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: none;
      box-shadow: none;
    }
    .vn-contacts-crimea__footer-note {
      padding: 16px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
